e7c65dbc9.webm?t=1773127768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon Switching Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose two weapons from the initial five types to build your own playstyle, then actively switch weapons to unleash powerful abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon possesses an enhancement that transforms its form, altering its normal attacks and skills into entirely different styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, you can infuse souls into weapons to enhance their stats, gaining an advantage in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/e1dfc687d3a2bd32f4aad9dc8ef9e60e.webp?t=1773127768\" width=1560 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/8a34053a681168760dc6bb07ed27a85b.poster.avif?t=1773127768\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/8a34053a681168760dc6bb07ed27a85b.webm?t=1773127768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Constant Threats, Repeated Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five distinct regions exist, each inhabited by unique races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold snowfields hold the ferocious wolf race, the tranquil forests hold the deer race, the stormy seas hold the shark race, the scorching desert holds the snake race, and the enchanted castle holds the fox race. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will relentlessly swarm you, and increasingly powerful foes will threaten your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swiftly eliminate enemies to harvest their souls, nurturing the Tree of Light on the battlefield to gather colored fruits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting these fruits grants you artifacts imbued with powerful effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 40 types of common enemies, over 10 types of elite foes, and formidable bosses,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >surviving in this faded world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/e1dfc687d3a2bd32f4aad9dc8ef9e60e.webp?t=1773127768\" width=1560 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/0cb3014d9a434c88df4a36d5af6e864f.poster.avif?t=1773127768\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/extras/0cb3014d9a434c88df4a36d5af6e864f.webm?t=1773127768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final Judgment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every path stands a leader of a race determined to stop you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike regular enemies, the leader possesses more deadly attacks and formidable vitality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the strength you've built up thus far, defeat the leader, and seize victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MYMEStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","i