?t=1773127768"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/3bd2799562afc200fca8e536e5c4ad0dd4d523d0/ss_3bd2799562afc200fca8e536e5c4ad0dd4d523d0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773127768","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224280/3bd2799562afc200fca8e536e5c4ad0dd4d523d0/ss_3bd2799562afc200fca8e536e5c4ad0dd4d523d0.600x338.jpg?t=1773127768"}],"short_description":"Soul Wander is a 2D roguelike action game. It tells the story of the \u201cFade,\u201d born with the special power to manipulate color in a village that has lost its hues. The Fade embarks on a perilous journey to restore the lost colors.","steam_appid":3224280,"support_info":{"email":"gamedev@gonggamore.co.kr","url":"gonggamore.co.kr"},"supported_languages":"Korean, English, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}